{"__ud_title":"扬州","__ud_tags":[],"__ud_update_time":1795161300832,"__ud_create_time":1795161248891,"__ud_draft":false,"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1,"id":"扬州"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有人说，","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天，一定要留一个篇章给"},{"type":"text","text":"扬州","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天，总要下一次江南啊。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如果说，中国最美的春天在江南。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"那么，江南最美的春天，必定在扬州"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/F206D750617FC4E94ED9A8788DBD4DC2E6539180_size198_w854_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一句“"},{"type":"text","text":"烟花三月下扬州”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，那时起，扬州就和春日紧紧地绑定在一起。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"很多人不知道，地处江北的扬州，但却被人誉为"},{"type":"text","text":"“最后的江南”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/29F350F831E4B4B81A2A1317B580956DD79257CF_size351_w854_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"01"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州 · 生动诗意的春韵","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天，无疑是扬州最诗意、也是最热闹的季节。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/81967DD08014D49C3047F297C3508C073B973F00_size366_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"袅袅青烟与丝丝细雨缱绻缠绵，山水园林，亭台楼榭的诗意，合并成这幅上了淡淡色彩的水墨画。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"蛰伏了一整个冬天的扬州，终于重新起笔，撰写新一年的诗词。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"石板小路，青石街巷、柳条垂钓、薄雾清风，诗中的对扬州的描述，在春天都有了更形象的展示。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"另外“闹”这个字眼，看似和诗意冲突，其实却不然。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"因为，这个“闹”只是相对而言，春天的百花齐放，算是斯文儒雅到骨子里的扬州最主动展示自己的时候。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"撒了一地浪漫的二月兰；"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/B20BCDCF9DB9369CCE2F2A12AF5E7D540133DF43_size142_w851_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"圣洁典雅的玉兰花；"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/8FC13125C4B921C29C388D3D8174988BEC99DB82_size61_w851_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"落英缤纷的樱花；"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/46D4B79EC452F0EE6889E543C689ABC8FB9B24A5_size256_w851_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"芬芳扑鼻的梅花；"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/6C6A18483990585B637706B96B1B7AED0A13893A_size414_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"花美名更美的琼花还是扬州的市花；"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/887AEB157FD02AD8458154473A405FF0542EE6CD_size143_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"就在所有地方都开心地说：“春天终于来了！”"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"唯有扬州，叹一句："},{"type":"text","text":"“此时正是烟花三月。”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/16921BEAADF7D56C5BCE267C01C469E2CB5B0EB6_size329_w718_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"02"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州 · “窗”中的盛景","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"来过扬州的，一定明白，赏诗意扬州的隐藏视角。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"那便是，“窗”中的扬州。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/5A98E1510313BFE2CBCE6B5D1CA05CC0DBCDB53F_size144_w852_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"园林里，街头上，走廊的墙上，总能看到刻意又无意留下的“窗”。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"将院中的景致，框出一个别致的画框，构图是怎样就要靠自己的眼睛。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这无疑是构成东方美学的中式建筑的重要一笔。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/6550B69B56D13B58AFA741EADECBE4E335EBA480_size76_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/C86B80D4D74BCD6AB0893DE34D62DD968A032180_size216_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"宠辱不惊，看庭前花开花落。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"去留无意，望天上云卷云舒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"节制里藏优雅，气韵中显格局。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/BADBC6DAAC990426FD1A9406110D4304D0EFB9CF_size89_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/7BABF1C4DF2FBB0053C88EE5CF4A195C18EABEDA_size97_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你根本不需要懂建筑，只需一眼，就会无可救药地爱上扬州的窗和窗中的扬州。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"也正是来了扬州，才能明白，为什么说"},{"type":"text","text":"中国人的房子有一种几千年凝练下来的美","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/B1B3F4956618334AE0D05510A3B4F5A61F647A67_size170_w1007_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"03"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州 · 比苏杭更秀美","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"瘦西湖","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"瘦西湖和杭州的西湖，一字相差，但气质可谓是大不相同。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"瘦西湖是一条狭长的河流，湖面时宽时窄，所以景致也是不断地变换的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"也因为她比杭州西湖更具一分清瘦神韵，而由此得名。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/579BA56ECA4C6D7974D314C2323E17E991C226F7_size119_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/70A2D1D0E34FC1D45615E4EC63B828AC1AC0C061_size100_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"来到一个不同的城市，总会有一瞬间有种“原来这就是传说中的...”的感觉。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看到薄雾作纱，遮住自己娇容瘦西湖，山水与草木仿佛是她身上的饰品，"},{"type":"text","text":"这一刻，方才真切的感受，自己来到了扬州。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/694860F559250F9D5F97627E2738CF05CE7B4690_size279_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"奈何这种美艳怎能藏得住，在艳阳直射当头的正午，这个姑娘便淡然接受所有人投来的赞许目光。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"怎么形容呢？简直是判若两湖吧。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"泛舟在缠绵的湖水之上，穿梭在花团锦簇的万花园中，游走在游人如织的岸边，有种粘稠又推拉的情愫，好像总是罩在这方天地。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/156DE5D5A5447FDD3473146F3AB52E4AA1D76E6C_size228_w718_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"到了傍晚时分，这种情绪到了顶点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"想起杜牧那首诗："},{"type":"text","text":"“青山隐隐水迢迢，秋尽江南草未凋，二十四桥明月夜，玉人何处教吹箫。”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"想必，乾隆皇帝当年就沉醉在这种逍遥里无法自拔吧。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/2071572B80784CFFE484D8FF8AFCC02C840455CD_size129_w852_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"即便千百年时光而过，也没能将瘦西湖这份情愫耗尽。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"前有多少慕名前来的文人墨客，后就有多少远赴而来的摄影爱好者。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"他们都有一个共同目的，就是把瘦西湖“刻画”下来。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/668DD3C878FA6A2861B9C5908F454195BEF8140E_size215_w720_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"个园","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这座清代扬州盐商宅邸私家园林，因为主人生性好竹子；而竹叶三片形似 “个”字，便取得这个名字。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"而走进个园，也就有了答案，抬头一看，有些阴沉的天空和片片竹叶，可不就像宣纸上灵动的那些“个”字。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/DB493021CF061CF56A2F1220969D2EC3D7977E3F_size263_w1080_h809.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/47BDC2FB2B1C319DDAA7D3C942A060BE7C3E5C00_size124_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"继续往里走，中间的花园便是整个园林造景最有意思的部分。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"错落有致的水池被假山灵巧地分隔开，周围各种造型奇特到让人眼花缭乱的太湖石。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不足五十亩的园子，开辟了"},{"type":"text","text":"春、夏、秋、冬","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"四个形态逼真的假山区，是"},{"type":"text","text":"中国园林的孤本。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/50984474C65CD17662E8FFD593C798C11D869D72_size344_w640_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"沿着青石铺就的小路，透过轻巧玲珑的洞门，园内的雅致映入眼中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"东中西三个院落，被狭长的小巷贯穿，行走其中，两眼是看不完的景。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"整个园子倒是很有江南烟雨的美感。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/2FC08939B1C4BA11B7E3E315AE02AD10D26B6FC2_size198_w1080_h808.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/FC66A3397979EA68BC3C4C61A2B9CC5619B56E19_size87_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来"},{"type":"text","text":"何园","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同个园一样，这也是一座私家园林。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"由何芷舠于清光绪年间建造，晚清园林建筑代表作，被称为晚清第一园。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/38E9A7E6C717F81230ACAD5D4291EA5F44AFB2EA_size218_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/33C33169F95A4512FE130FC3271774F1AD5A692A_size167_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"串起整个园林的是一条长1500米的复道回廊。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"左右分流、高低勾搭、衔山环水、登堂入室，一路走下来有一种在走立体迷宫的感觉。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/7738FEA3D33687BCE24AA5D3B09E25E994A25D04_size105_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/67B055FA8C3BEA644DD397D14CF3030C12389892_size75_w1080_h460.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"与晴天相比，落雨时候，反倒更具韵味。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"要知道，瓦是喜欢雨的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"串串雨珠落在瓦上，总像是在弹琴一般，轻巧灵动。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/FC085B0E152D323612CDE37FE71AB71417C43B56_size92_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在湿润的回廊徘徊，"},{"type":"text","text":"满眼的幽静和甜美","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"所有的一切舒缓着浑身每一个细胞，让人醉在这幅画里。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/EC9F7FAC89E529BF4D02215ECE3EFDE5583486B1_size149_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/DC5C23982683CB3402B8412A6F1DC8285B3C5D64_size87_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"04"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州 · 香火绵延","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"大明寺","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作为一个寺院而言，大明寺真的很美。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小桥流水，鸟语花香，一应俱全。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"园林寺的布置，为寺庙增添了些许幽静。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/F90292B4CBD7E9E397ED4957B59A6A9F6C3CBD5B_size125_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/E6A6557970509FE99C2CDABB18121708BD3EA69F_size104_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"而寺内给人印象最深的应该是栖灵塔了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在去大明寺的路上和瘦西湖里，远远的都能看到它高耸的身影。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"登上栖灵塔顶，可以尽揽扬州风光","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，很推荐登顶看一看。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/A92C3D7D43E3ACEF1C7C42DBB241A2C583D91276_size238_w852_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"观音山","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"观音山在瘦西湖的北边，比起其西边不远处的大明寺，要静谧不少。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"来观音山拜佛的主要以当地人为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两侧的黄色矮墙边，总有探出头的绿意，这种色差感也很是和谐。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同时，这里还是扬州的自然制高点，远眺江淮南北，一览无余，在这里远眺，身心特别舒畅。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/5134863F3AFD5A8C3A91A773FA9F4754CBF8185C_size194_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/43418C8CAFF24BDDEC09736647CF07E6B4BB81BD_size220_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作为一座小而精致又富特色的山间禅寺。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从进门上山到石香台观音殿，再到下山出门，似乎都恰到好处得被巧妙构建在一起。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/5437EC1817A829DB21ACA472F92C2C868227FFC0_size334_w973_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"05"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州 · 清新与古朴并存","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"鉴真图书馆","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作为国内第一家佛教图书馆。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"尤其是春天，这里绝对值得一去，图书馆后面是个茶园，在这里看书称得上是种别样的人生享受。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/A187FC65FF35ED4EC1ACE8B8525E92839FD3CEFE_size215_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"其次，四月迎来了樱花季。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在馆外，有一条樱花大道。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"那一树的粉装，娇而不羞，像成熟而又典雅的女子，仰头看着一片片随风飘落的花瓣，纷纷扬扬的飘落在行人的肩上，头上，草丛间，小路上。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/0FE65849E1D13CF4F133A3FB315D64883E991D8A_size171_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/5AD704AC7C964E53B6A5D46D15CE1D95F890B5CB_size219_w1080_h607.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"扬州大学","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。(","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"扬州大学历史悠久。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"学校前身是1902年由近代著名"},{"type":"text","text":"实业家","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%9A%E5%AE%B6/1411249"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"教育家","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E5%AE%B6/10341583"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"张謇","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%BC%A0%E8%AC%87/1129763"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"先生创办的"},{"type":"text","text":"通州师范学校"},{"type":"text","text":"和"},{"type":"text","text":"通海农学堂。"},{"type":"text","text":"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%89%AC%E5%B7%9E%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6）","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州大学有七个校区，分别有着不同的优美风景。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在扬州大学校内走走逛逛，有几分厦大的同感。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/A31B1515B50B8EAC16996440DF0860F24C78C74D_size70_w1080_h607.jpg"}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/AB1F36F1D9FC153F42275CCF13F9FAF472B6C470_size263_w1080_h719.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"细细观察，校园里有很多小确幸。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"路边时不时就能看到公益箱，被喂食的小猫，餐盒总是装得满满的，"},{"type":"text","text":"这种校园里的纯真善良真的很美好。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/E21C562A42B6930371535428322F95A22F2D3B24_size133_w1080_h810.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"东关街","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"东关街是古扬州的水陆交通要道，街头就是古运河码头所在。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"而今，岁月流逝，这里成为扬州城里最具有代表性的一条历史老街。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/3CE0EF3E0045AA73A82ED1E3CF0144FF71E21095_size274_w854_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你可以漫无目的的在一条条小巷中走走停停。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"主道人来人往，转到一条小巷就像来到截然不同的世界","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，静谧又有时间的做旧感。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"值得一提的是，东关街中段有一棵楝树，春天楝树开花，沁人的香气走了很远都还能闻到。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/BA5D9FDEDC474D3D475B0CCA47EA1FF2DDB6F417_size353_w960_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"春天来扬州，一定要来"},{"type":"text","text":"南河下","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"南河下片区和此前的“双东”片区一样，是老扬州耳熟能详的地方。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小巷深宅中，古宅遗迹俯拾皆是，老井、砖雕门楼、古树随处可见。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/259CBE058ADD335F677275EA4D1AC41D9064ECA8_size289_w851_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这里的老街区道路很窄，但是扑面而来的生活的气息也是一种特色。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小街小巷，干净悠闲，少许破落，转角却可能有无比精致的私家园林藏身。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"06"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"比成都慵懒","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"比老广会享受","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州生活节奏慢，最明显的就体现在"},{"type":"text","text":"“吃”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"其他地方的人，早饭吃得匆忙，对付几口就罢，而扬州单是吃早茶，就要从一大早吃到中午头。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"相约几人一起去茶楼，一杯酽茶、一屉包子，点一个小菜，能唠上许久。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/BABD0804A52AB41CE6CCF1993F7403D16DCA810F_size145_w1046_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"“早上皮包水，晚上水包皮”","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"是扬州人的人生信条。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"意思就是早上吃汤包，晚上去泡澡，把小日子安排得妥妥当当。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在吃上，他们可谓是拿出了绝对用心的研究。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/484D9D79762265ED3F9B34341E25D41E32B62FD3_size85_w1080_h1078.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当年康熙、乾隆皇帝，将淮扬菜水平带到了极高的高度，堪称人间至味。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"而今，作为被联合国评选为「世界美食之都」之一，你以为就单靠一碗扬州炒饭吗？"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/7EAD057C4E2BBCB0A169DC41BDB8A079F0169C67_size1495_w437_h246.gif"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州人讲究早茶文化，"},{"type":"text","text":"茶，肴，干丝，面条，包子","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（淮扬细点），样样都是门学问"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"说起来朴实无华， 但你要展开了说，这里面可细了去了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"朴实无华又特别好吃的"},{"type":"text","text":"扬州炒饭 ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/CC121FE565829400AD8E7B10D44BCA33F663FACE_size104_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"桌桌必点的一定有这道"},{"type":"text","text":"烫干丝","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ☟"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/7E1EBB73170F17DEC0EDF341D60F0E959FE67DEB_size83_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一碗"},{"type":"text","text":"饺面","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"感受碳水带来的幸福感 ☟"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/6B59865A73DB70FFBBB64A05E94A8353808E1A46_size107_w1080_h721.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"蟹黄汤包","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，先喝汤,包更香 "}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/288FB9CFA9C5F387B7550BDB096F5A7BF846813F_size114_w1080_h722.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"香上加香，鲜了又鲜的"},{"type":"text","text":"蟹粉狮子头","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ☟"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/F1C21F25EB4D75C0C22222045D185790D9CEB379_size82_w1080_h772.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"入口即化的"},{"type":"text","text":"文思豆腐","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"就像是一个艺术品 ☟"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/E73D38AA76B42DBB61D2AE19A2F75BB4AAF598D0_size77_w1080_h720.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"软烂入味的 "},{"type":"text","text":"老鹅","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 香味是层层递进的 ☟"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/A08DF7FBE9E99CFFD57C252BCCFE821BE45D5905_size81_w1080_h607.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不得不说，生活在扬州可太幸福了，他们"},{"type":"text","text":"在追求高品质精神生活的同时，也没忘留有足够的时间品足人间美味。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如果你也想感受，城市的惬意，但又不能吃辣。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"选料鲜活，刀工精湛，火候讲究，清淡雅致的淮扬菜一定要尝尝。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/E1B16D6436FDAB8B9A011DD495E4BDFA937414CB_size866_w484_h225.gif"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有人说，扬州作为一个城市来说，还是不算繁华。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"没错，扬州作为一个三线小城，生活节奏不快，工资水平在三线城市中等，一辆电动车在主城区半天就可以兜个遍，夜生活也不算太丰富......"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"但还是有无数人愿意来到这里，留在这里。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/CE81DA3D84FD3BF521E7E0D0C9AA605606766E0F_size83_w826_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"流光溢彩，是中国的城市。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"月光如水，亦是中国的城市。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如果所有城市都成为一个模子的“批量生产”还有什么意思呢？"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/EFAB07E2C26BF98B39A51779EC8805642186E431_size58_w876_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州，可能跟繁华沾不上边，但是它的代表词从来不少。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"城在园中，园在城中。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"扬州不像一个城市，更像是一个大花园，春天更甚。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/FFB7FDD7B5450F3F839D112973017F7BE60820D9_size176_w854_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"腰缠十万贯，骑鹤上扬州。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从古至今，这片清雅恬淡的水墨之地，一直未失宠。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2022_15/F6B2F8598563AB3B4D14A3DF36895E64D4E3A6E3_size302_w853_h1280.jpg"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如果你厌倦现在的生活，不如就来扬州小住几日。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"行在诗词里，","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"活在烟火里","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不由得感慨，人生啊，真的值得！","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"from ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"https://travel.ifeng.com/c/8F2WKlxRB0V","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "}]}]}